                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>No official record of the conversation at this dinner has been found. The
                    information set forth above is derived from the Log, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg529">p. 529</ref>. According to Elliott
                    Roosevelt, p. 103, no substantive business was discussed.</p>
            </div>
